<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About <strong>30\u201360 minutes per run</strong>, or longer if you stop to overthink the toast.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Featuring:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghibli-style visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bizarre mix of horror, dark comedy, and surreal cult energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No voice acting. Just lots of text. And narration. And text about narration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torgo. So much Torgo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cYou cannot escape Manos. But you might get out with your luggage.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThe Hands of Fate\u2026 now in click-to-choose format.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cInspired by retro horror, bad decisions, and slightly burnt bread.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
